# A familiar worry is the scope of "necessarily" in P1 (S2): necessity of the consequence versus necessity of the consequent.
# That ambiguity sits in the modal operator around foreseen_happens, not in the words of the claim. In P1, P2 and A1 the claim itself says the same thing: what is foreseen comes to pass.
